{"5189160":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"We March as One","steam_appid":5189160,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We March as One is an incremental-style auto battler about building a massive army of shapes.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paint Your Army<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/198a9263049b3618e606dc9451f2a90b.poster.avif?t=1792425821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/198a9263049b3618e606dc9451f2a90b.webm?t=1792425821\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/198a9263049b3618e606dc9451f2a90b.mp4?t=1792425821\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint your troops directly onto the battlefield however you like<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactically position them to counter the enemy force<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Units<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/37dc33043c8032ac58616764e2319372.poster.avif?t=1792425821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/37dc33043c8032ac58616764e2319372.webm?t=1792425821\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/37dc33043c8032ac58616764e2319372.mp4?t=1792425821\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold from defeated enemies, whether you win or lose the battle<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recruit more troops, unlock new unit types from a branching skill tree, and return with a stronger army<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fallen troops return for the next battle, so you keep the army you’ve built<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massive Battles<\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/301ae21b7ad2282607bef4d7fdbe332b.poster.avif?t=1792425821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/301ae21b7ad2282607bef4d7fdbe332b.webm?t=1792425821\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/301ae21b7ad2282607bef4d7fdbe332b.mp4?t=1792425821\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every soldier and projectile individually simulated<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Isometric, top-down, or fly-through modes give you multiple ways to view the action<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with unusual army compositions across different battlefield layouts<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We March as One is an incremental-style auto battler about building a massive army of shapes.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paint Your Army<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/198a9263049b3618e606dc9451f2a90b.poster.avif?t=1792425821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/198a9263049b3618e606dc9451f2a90b.webm?t=1792425821\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/198a9263049b3618e606dc9451f2a90b.mp4?t=1792425821\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint your troops directly onto the battlefield however you like<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactically position them to counter the enemy force<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Units<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/37dc33043c8032ac58616764e2319372.poster.avif?t=1792425821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/37dc33043c8032ac58616764e2319372.webm?t=1792425821\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/37dc33043c8032ac58616764e2319372.mp4?t=1792425821\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold from defeated enemies, whether you win or lose the battle<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recruit more troops, unlock new unit types from a branching skill tree, and return with a stronger army<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fallen troops return for the next battle, so you keep the army you’ve built<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massive Battles<\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/301ae21b7ad2282607bef4d7fdbe332b.poster.avif?t=1792425821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/301ae21b7ad2282607bef4d7fdbe332b.webm?t=1792425821\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/extras\/301ae21b7ad2282607bef4d7fdbe332b.mp4?t=1792425821\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every soldier and projectile individually simulated<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Isometric, top-down, or fly-through modes give you multiple ways to view the action<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with unusual army compositions across different battlefield layouts<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Start with a few shapes and build an army tens of thousands strong. Paint your troops onto the battlefield and send them to war against enormous hordes in this incremental auto battler where every unit is individually simulated.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/52bc72368a29a1a13173db5ec3481a242422a6ca\/header.jpg?t=1792425821","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/8e04412b9aa23678b8c795c80cfb74291ee21401\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792425821","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5189160\/8e04412b9aa23678b8c795c80cfb74291ee21401\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792425821","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit (21H1 or newer)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core CPU — Intel Core i5-6400 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8192 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any DirectX 11 capable GPU with 1 GB VRAM (GeForce GTX 750 \/ Radeon R7 260 \/ Intel UHD 630)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2048 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[]}}}